        M("settings.acquisition.importModeDescription", "Hardlink keeps the download seeding while the library sees the file, using no extra disk space, but only works when the completed-download folder and the library root are on the same filesystem. Plain Hardlink fails the import with a clear reason on a different filesystem; \"Hardlink or copy\" is the explicit choice to fall back to a copy then.", "Settings", "Body", "Explains the tradeoffs of the Hardlink import mode versus Hardlink or copy.", "clear technical copy", 350, null, ["Hardlink", "Hardlink or copy"]),
