        M("settings.acquisition.mediaFoldersHeading", "Media folders", "Settings", "Heading", "Heading of the panel that sets the library and inbox folders of Manga, Light Novels and Books.", "clear heading", 24),
        M("settings.acquisition.mediaFoldersDescription", "Each reading media type has its own folders. Completed Manga downloads are placed into the Manga library folder with its import mode; without a folder they are read where the download client put them. Light Novels and Books are read into Jularr's library. The inbox folder is for files Jularr did not download: Scan inbox imports them with the same importer, and a file already imported is not imported again. Choose each folder with Browse, or enter its path as the Jularr container sees it.", "Settings", "Body", "Explains the per-media library and inbox folders, what an empty library folder means, that the inbox is imported with the same importer and idempotently, and that folders are chosen with the folder browser or entered as container paths.", "clear technical copy", 500),
