        M("settings.acquisition.indexerRestrictionsDescription", "Restricts anime carrying any of the selected tags to searching only the checked indexers (a whole Prowlarr connection, or a direct Newznab connection). Narrows which indexers are searched at all; never widens it. If a restriction ends up with no enabled indexer allowed, no indexer is searched for that anime — it is never silently searched unrestricted.", "Settings", "Body", "Explains how tag-scoped indexer restrictions narrow (never widen) indexer search, and fail closed rather than open.", "clear technical copy", 400, null, ["Prowlarr", "Newznab"]),
